{"format":"frame-text","version":1,"id":"594d07b2-e46c-489c-abc9-e47eab81e82c","title":"7. Images, schémas et formules","created":"2026-11-18T08:00:00.000Z","modified":"2026-11-18T08:00:00.000Z","settings":{"autoIndent":false,"titleInText":true,"columns":{"count":1,"rule":false},"languages":["fr"],"index":[],"comments":[],"theme":{"v":1,"id":"moderne","name":"Moderne","note":"Open Sans et Montserrat, bleu, tableaux à bandes.","modified":false,"text":{"font":"Open Sans","size":11,"line":1.55,"space":0.7,"align":""},"accent":"#2e5c8a","styles":{"title":{"font":"Montserrat","size":24,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},"headings":[{"font":"Montserrat","size":18,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":14,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2e5c8a","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":12,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":true,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Montserrat","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":true,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""}],"bullets":[{"symbol":"–","color":""},{"symbol":"•","color":""},{"symbol":"◦","color":""},{"symbol":"▪","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""}],"numbers":["1","1","1","1","1"]},"table":{"style":"grille","color":"theme","header":true,"first":false,"total":false,"last":false,"bands":true,"bandcols":false,"sep":false,"font":"","size":0,"pad":""},"callout":{"look":"trait","color":""},"quote":{"look":"guillemets","color":""},"toc":{"title":"Au sommaire","showTitle":true,"titleStyle":"majuscules","titleAlign":"gauche","docTitle":true,"levels":5,"font":"","size":0,"color":"#2e6da4","frame":"fond","number":"I","leaders":true,"indent":true,"preset":"encadre"},"diagram":{"fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#2e86c1","textColor":"#1b4f72","link":"#2e86c1","font":"Segoe UI","strokeWidth":2,"shadow":false,"palette":false},"code":{"palette":"clair","frame":"cadre","font":"","size":0,"num":false,"line":""},"margins":null},"mode":"note","pages":{"size":"A4","w":210,"h":297,"orient":"portrait","turned":{},"margins":{"top":25,"bottom":25,"left":25,"right":25},"numbers":{"on":true,"pos":"bas-centre","format":"1","from":1,"first":1,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"box":"aucun","skip":{}},"header":{"on":true,"html":""},"footer":{"on":true,"html":""},"firstDifferent":false,"keep":true,"chapters":0,"tagsAfterCover":true,"custom":false}},"content":{"html":"<h1 class=\"ft-title\">Images, schémas et formules</h1><h2>Images</h2><span class=\"ft-image\" data-num=\"figure\" data-xid=\"fig-image\" data-wrap=\"droite\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"width: 34%\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"><span class=\"ft-caption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-cap=\"Figure 1\">Image habillée à droite, avec légende numérotée</span></span><p>Une image s’insère par le bouton <b>Image</b>, par glisser-déposer depuis l’Explorateur ou par collage. Sélectionnée, elle se redimensionne par ses poignées ; sa barre propose la position et l’habillage (texte autour, à gauche, à droite), un cadre et une légende.</p><p>Une légende numérotée (« Figure 1 ») permet de citer l’image ailleurs par un renvoi : <span class=\"ft-xref\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-target=\"x:fig-image\" data-show=\"label\" title=\"Renvoi vers figure : Image habillée à droite, avec légende numérotée (Ctrl+clic : y aller ; double-clic : modifier)\">figure 1</span>.</p><h2>Schémas</h2><p>Le bouton <b>Schéma</b> ouvre un éditeur de formes reliées par des connecteurs : organigrammes, cycles, cartes mentales, graphes de fonctions. Un double-clic sur un schéma le rouvre pour le modifier.</p><span class=\"ft-image ft-diagram\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-diagram=\"{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;background&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;,&quot;nodes&quot;:[{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;ellipse&quot;,&quot;w&quot;:110,&quot;h&quot;:52,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Écrire&quot;,&quot;fill&quot;:&quot;#fde2e1&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#c8402c&quot;,&quot;strokeWidth&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shadow&quot;:false,&quot;opacity&quot;:1,&quot;font&quot;:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;bold&quot;:false,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;textColor&quot;:&quot;#78281f&quot;,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;a&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0},{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;arrondi&quot;,&quot;w&quot;:130,&quot;h&quot;:52,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Illustrer&quot;,&quot;fill&quot;:&quot;#fde2e1&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#c8402c&quot;,&quot;strokeWidth&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shadow&quot;:false,&quot;opacity&quot;:1,&quot;font&quot;:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;bold&quot;:false,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;textColor&quot;:&quot;#78281f&quot;,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:150,&quot;y&quot;:0},{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;arrondi&quot;,&quot;w&quot;:130,&quot;h&quot;:52,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Relire&quot;,&quot;fill&quot;:&quot;#fde2e1&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#c8402c&quot;,&quot;strokeWidth&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shadow&quot;:false,&quot;opacity&quot;:1,&quot;font&quot;:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;bold&quot;:false,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;textColor&quot;:&quot;#78281f&quot;,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;c&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:320,&quot;y&quot;:0},{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;arrondi&quot;,&quot;w&quot;:130,&quot;h&quot;:52,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Exporter&quot;,&quot;fill&quot;:&quot;#d5f5e3&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#27ae60&quot;,&quot;strokeWidth&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shadow&quot;:false,&quot;opacity&quot;:1,&quot;font&quot;:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;bold&quot;:true,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;textColor&quot;:&quot;#145a32&quot;,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;d&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:490,&quot;y&quot;:0},{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;note&quot;,&quot;w&quot;:130,&quot;h&quot;:52,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Commentaires&quot;,&quot;fill&quot;:&quot;#fcf3cf&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#d4ac0d&quot;,&quot;strokeWidth&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shadow&quot;:false,&quot;opacity&quot;:1,&quot;font&quot;:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;fontSize&quot;:14,&quot;bold&quot;:false,&quot;italic&quot;:false,&quot;textColor&quot;:&quot;#7d6608&quot;,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;e&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:320,&quot;y&quot;:100}],&quot;links&quot;:[{&quot;route&quot;:&quot;coude&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8c7b70&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;pleine&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;l1&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;a&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;e&quot;},&quot;to&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;w&quot;}},{&quot;route&quot;:&quot;coude&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8c7b70&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;pleine&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;l2&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;e&quot;},&quot;to&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;c&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;w&quot;}},{&quot;route&quot;:&quot;coude&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8c7b70&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;pleine&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;l3&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;c&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;e&quot;},&quot;to&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;d&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;w&quot;}},{&quot;route&quot;:&quot;coude&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8c7b70&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1.5,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;tirets&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;pleine&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;l4&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;c&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;s&quot;},&quot;to&quot;:{&quot;node&quot;:&quot;e&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;n&quot;}}]}\" data-num=\"schema\" data-xid=\"sch-etapes\" style=\"width: 92%;\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"><span class=\"ft-caption\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-cap=\"Schéma 1\">Les étapes d’un document</span></span><h2>Formules</h2><p>Le bouton <b>Formule</b> insère une formule mathématique, dans la ligne (<span class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-latex=\"E=mc^2\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:0.87em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.06em\">E</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">=</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__mathit\">mc</span><span class=\"ML__msubsup\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-t\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:0.87em\"><span style=\"top:-3.41em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.46em;display:inline-block;font-size: 70%\"><span class=\"ML__cmr\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) ou centrée sur sa propre ligne :</p><div class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-display=\"block\" data-latex=\"\\bar{x}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_i\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:1.66em\"></span><span class=\"ML__strut--bottom\" style=\"height:2.93em;vertical-align:-1.27em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-t\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:0.57em\"><span style=\"top:-3em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.44em;display:inline-block\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">x</span></span></span><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-3em;margin-left:0.04em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"ML__accent-body\" style=\"height:0.57em;display:inline-block\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">=</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__mfrac\"><span class=\"ML__nulldelimiter ML__open\" style=\"width:0.12em\"></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em\"><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-2.31em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.44em;display:inline-block\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"ML__frac-line\" style=\"height:0.04em;display:inline-block\"></span></span><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-3.5em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.65em;display:inline-block\"><span class=\"ML__cmr\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:0.69em\"></span></span></span><span class=\"ML__nulldelimiter ML__close\" style=\"width:0.12em\"></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.17em\"></span><span class=\"ML__op-group\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:1.66em\"><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-1.87em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.47em;display:inline-block;font-size: 70%\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">i</span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">=1</span></span></span><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-3.05em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em\"></span><span style=\"height:1.61em;display:inline-block\"><span class=\"ML__op-symbol ML__large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span class=\"ML__center\" style=\"top:-4.3em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.31em;display:inline-block;font-size: 70%\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:1.28em\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.17em\"></span><span class=\"ML__mathit\">x</span><span class=\"ML__msubsup\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2\"><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:0.32em\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"ML__pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span style=\"height:0.47em;display:inline-block;font-size: 70%\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"ML__vlist-r\"><span class=\"ML__vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>L’éditeur de formules propose les symboles courants (fractions, racines, sommes, lettres grecques) ; la syntaxe LaTeX est aussi acceptée. Un double-clic sur une formule la modifie.</p><h2>Autres objets</h2><table class=\"ft-table\" data-demo-look=\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;liste&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;theme&quot;,&quot;header&quot;:true,&quot;first&quot;:true,&quot;sep&quot;:true,&quot;bands&quot;:true}\" data-style=\"grille\" data-color=\"theme\" data-header=\"oui\" data-bands=\"oui\" data-t=\"2\"><tbody><tr><td>Outil</td><td>Usage</td></tr><tr><td>Repère biographique</td><td>Courte notice sur une personne (portrait, dates, présentation), à côté du texte.</td></tr><tr><td>Lettrine</td><td>Grande initiale en début de paragraphe, pour un chapitre ou un article.</td></tr><tr><td>Bloc de code</td><td>Code informatique coloré selon le langage.</td></tr><tr><td>Caractères spéciaux</td><td>Symboles, lettres accentuées, flèches ; les favoris s’affichent au survol.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>À essayer</h2><ul class=\"ft-check\"><li>Cliquer sur l’image ci-dessus et changer son habillage.</li><li>Double-cliquer sur le schéma, ajouter une forme, puis fermer l’éditeur.</li><li>Insérer une formule sur la ligne ci-dessous.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Suite :</b> <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"ab4dcb83-1658-4f5d-a12a-ee336ac8566d\">Liens, notes et sources</a>.</p>"},"tags":[{"name":"Tutoriel","color":"rouge"},{"name":"Écrire","color":"bleu"}],"links":[],"meta":{}}